  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large terracotta vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground beef and cook, breaking it up with a spoon, until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chickpeas, diced tomatoes, and 1 cup of water to the vessel.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in some chopped fresh parsley before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired.",
    "Cook ground beef to an internal temperature of 71°C / 160°F (no longer pink in the middle) before serving."
